      "obligation": "refuter:42:1",
      "id": "thm-nrqm-magnetic-and-detection-bounded-coefficient-magnetic-operator",
      "location": "Statement (d)",
      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "The claim quantifies over every $a\\in[0,1)$, including $a=0$. Take $\\hbar=m=q=1$, $A=(1,0,0)$ constant, and $\\Phi=0$, which are admissible data. Then $K_{A,0}-K_0=-P_1+\\tfrac12 I$. By the in-scope momentum lemma, $P_1$ is the Fourier multiplier $2\\pi\\xi_1$. Unit vectors whose Fourier transforms are supported in $[n,n+1]\\times[0,1]^2$ belong to $W^{2,2}$ and have $\\|(K_{A,0}-K_0)u_n\\|\\ge 2\\pi n-\\tfrac12$. Thus no finite $b$ gives the asserted inequality for $a=0$.",
      "severity": "fatal",
      "observed_sha256": "99906a93ae02b6afa8a9fa148cbaaac8d9c50a76391e7831216c7268ab4efa67"
    },
    {
      "obligation": "refuter:42:2",
      "id": "thm-nrqm-magnetic-and-detection-gauge-transported-propagator",
      "location": "Proof 3.2",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "The cited gauge-domain result says each $G(t)$ preserves $W^{2,2}$ and that $t\\mapsto G(t)h$ is continuous for fixed $h\\in L^2$; it does not assert continuity in the $W^{2,2}$ norm. Proof 3.2 nevertheless infers from [F2] that $\\varphi(t)=G(t)^{-1}v(t)$ is continuous into $W^{2,2}$. The gap occurs under the stated hypotheses: for nonzero $q$, choose $\\eta\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R)$ and $\\chi(x,t)=t^2\\eta(x_1)\\sin(x_1/t)$ for $t\\ne0$, $\\chi(x,0)=0$. On $I=(-1,1)$ this has uniformly bounded first and second spatial derivatives and bounded pointwise time derivative, but $D_1^2\\chi$ contains $-\\eta(x_1)\\sin(x_1/t)$, which does not converge strongly in $L^2$ when multiplied by a smooth $f$ with $\\eta f\\ne0$. Hence the claimed $W^{2,2}$ continuity does not follow. Uniqueness can instead be shown by differentiating the norm of the difference of the transformed $L^2$ solutions, so this proof gap is nonfatal.",
      "severity": "nonfatal",
      "observed_sha256": "51912e788af129469073b759718597c0a27a67bd82828dcf9e37dea321cbb57e"
    }
  ],
